  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Always stay future-forward with the Nike P6000. Refreshing the 2006 Air Pegasus with space-age details, these shoes ensure your strides become a journey of comfort and style. Decked out with an aesthetic that's out of this world, these breathable sneakers come with a metallic fabric in the upper that features horizontal and vertical overlays in chrome synthetic leather. Rounded off with a foam midsole that provides lightweight cushioning, the Nike P6000 is engineered for every pace. So, whatever's next, take it on in style!</p> <ul> <li>Reflective details enable visibility in low-light conditions. </li> <li>Rubber outsole provides a no-slip grip and traction and adds durability.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment.</p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for a sneaker that looks sharp and stays easy underfoot. Inspired by early-2000s Nike running style, the Nike P-6000 blends breathable mesh, layered synthetic detailing, and lightweight foam cushioning for an everyday ride that feels comfortable from the first wear.</p><ul><li>Breathable mesh upper with layered synthetic overlays</li><li>Foam midsole provides lightweight cushioning</li><li>Reflective details help enhance visibility in low light</li><li>Rubber outsole adds durable traction</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Reviewers most often say the fit is true to size, so for the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size. If you prefer a little extra room up front or are between sizes, a half-size up may feel more relaxed.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for everyday wear, walking, commuting, travel, and light gym sessions when you want retro running style with all-day comfort.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>Heritage running lines give the P-6000 an easy mix of sporty and street-ready appeal, so it pairs well with joggers, shorts, denim, and casual work fits. Reviewers frequently call out how naturally it transitions from school or the office to weekends and travel.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say comfort is there right away, with a stable, supportive feel for long hours on your feet. Some note the sole starts with a slightly firmer feel, then settles into a smooth everyday ride, and many shoppers highlight solid hold-up through regular rotation.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike P-6000 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Navy/White/Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>CN0149-400</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; col